        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-484, French Colonial Knob Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis RK International Hardware made cabinet knob backplate is fashioned in the traditional French Colonial style. The ribbon and reed design is well known and will be sure to add a bit of old world charm to your home. The Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Knob Rose is available in antique english, distressed copper, oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, polished nickel, and distressed nickel finishes. Available in a 1-3/8 inch diameter and a larger 1-5/8 inch diameter. It is suitable for use with any cabinet knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse with matching <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-with-floral-center-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-754\"><b>CK-754 Ribbon and Reed with Floral Center Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-BP-484:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-BP-485:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
